  "summary": "wiselllx ships install-time beacon exfiltrating host metadata",
  "details": "The package ships beacon.cjs which, using Node's built-in http/https modules, collects host and process metadata (os module data, process.cwd(), process.version) and transmits it to a remote endpoint. The package has no legitimate functionality consistent with this behavior and matches the shape of a reconnaissance beacon used to profile installer environments ahead of follow-on compromise.",
